==Battleground==
*3 [[Metal One Horn]]s spawn, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[The Red Malice]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The short time you have until Red Malice spawns pretty much allows you to save up for one [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] or [[:Category:Special Cats#Mythic Cats|Mythic]], and the combination of Red Malice and constantly-spawning [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal Enemies]] means you will probably have to play this stage close to your base and hope for good RNG with [[Critical Hit|Criticals]]. Use units like [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Hurricat]] to handle the Metal Enemies, and then spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] or anti-Red Ubers to hit Red Malice hard once you clear out the Metals peons.

